{"page":565,"verses":[{"verse_key":"68:17","surah":68,"ayah":17,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّا بَلَوْنَـٰهُمْ كَمَا بَلَوْنَآ أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلْجَنَّةِ إِذْ أَقْسَمُوا۟ لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا مُصْبِحِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have tried them as We tried the owners of a certain garden, who swore that they would harvest its fruits in the morning","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَلَوْنَـٰهُمْ","en_gloss":"have tried them","transliteration":"balawnāhum","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَلَوْنَآ","en_gloss":"We tried","transliteration":"balawnā","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"(the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥāba","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the garden","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَقْسَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"they swore","transliteration":"aqsamū","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَيَصْرِمُنَّهَا","en_gloss":"to pluck its fruit","transliteration":"layaṣrimunnahā","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مُصْبِحِينَ","en_gloss":"(in the) morning","transliteration":"muṣ'biḥīna","verse_key":"68:17"},{"pos":11,"ar":"١٧","en_gloss":"(17)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"68:17"}]},{"verse_key":"68:18","surah":68,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا يَسْتَثْنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and made no allowance [for the Will of God]:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"68:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَثْنُونَ","en_gloss":"making exception","transliteration":"yastathnūna","verse_key":"68:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"68:18"}]},{"verse_key":"68:19","surah":68,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"فَطَافَ عَلَيْهَا طَآئِفٌ مِّن رَّبِّكَ وَهُمْ نَآئِمُ